0..75 Comment "//! `imported-rules` refuses an incomplete join through an imported theory."
76..79 Comment "//!"
80..156 Comment "//! The checker completes the imported `Monoid` rules and the local rules as"
157..233 Comment "//! one block, as for rules of one source. `Swapping` leaves a critical pair"
234..303 Comment "//! with incomparable normal forms. With the imported left unit rule,"
304..381 Comment "//! `mul (one ()) (pair x y)` reads `pair x y` and `pair y x`. The path order"
382..431 Comment "//! orients neither form. The checker refuses it."
432..435 Comment "//!"
436..452 Comment "//! - see: #1224"
454..510 Comment "// The source imports the semigroup and monoid theories."
